Bidirectional text support, set aside for now.

gano lays text out left to right and leaves bidirectional reordering to
the terminal, which does its own.  Doing bidi properly is a large job
for later.  These are the pieces that were written for it:

  bidi-class.scm                     Unicode Bidi_Class table, (gano bidi-class)
  bracket-pairs.scm                  Unicode Bidi_Paired_Bracket table, (gano bracket-pairs)
  generate_bidi_class.py             generators for those two tables
  generate_bracket_pairs.py
  test-char-bidi-and-brackets.scm    the tests of the char-*-bracket* and
                                     char-*-bidi-* helpers that (gano char)
                                     used to export on top of them

The bracket table may come back for bracket matching.
